# Git is now CODE-ONLY. Per-generation artifacts (embedder.json, per-worm
# weights.json, winner.json) are no longer committed here — multiple servers
# racing to push them to one shared branch failed non-fast-forward and bloated
# history with ~19M lines of JSON. The winning worm of each generation is now
# published to board_publish/ (outside the repo) and served at /board over the
# tunnel; see server/board_publish.py and
# docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-30-board-publish-pipeline-design.md.
# So the whole data/ tree is ignored. (Any data/ files still TRACKED from before
# this change are intentionally left alone until an off-disk backup exists — do
# NOT `git rm`/reset them, since those files live only on this disk.)
data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.cloudflared/
